    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kharnym Island Post would like to welcome you as a permanent member of our post office team, effective immediately. You will be living in the beautiful downtown Wistvale Post Office, mingle with many of the island\u2019s friendly residents, and become an essential part of our town\u2019s weekly operation with work so rewarding you\u2019ll never want to leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/76d7ea3631fea29cdf1142284523e30e.poster.avif?t=1755708810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/76d7ea3631fea29cdf1142284523e30e.webm?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/76d7ea3631fea29cdf1142284523e30e.mp4?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamp and process mail from our customers, a vital step in the mailing ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/aad48cc6c246042a2db451711a3ded70.poster.avif?t=1755708810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/aad48cc6c246042a2db451711a3ded70.webm?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/aad48cc6c246042a2db451711a3ded70.mp4?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort mail to ensure it gets to their correct locations.\u00a0 Let's keep the wheels of progress moving forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/6469162e5ded5f789689c6d6e423f005.poster.avif?t=1755708810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/6469162e5ded5f789689c6d6e423f005.webm?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/6469162e5ded5f789689c6d6e423f005.mp4?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our state of the art shredder will get rid of any unwanted items that end up in the mail system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, meet all the colorful characters of Kharnym Island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/98f75e2c3ff825384e9a3d44bf3de934.poster.avif?t=1755708810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/98f75e2c3ff825384e9a3d44bf3de934.webm?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/98f75e2c3ff825384e9a3d44bf3de934.mp4?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compensation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free room/board, weekly pay depending on experience/work ethic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect to be contacted by your supervisor Liv very shortly, and welcome to your new home!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kharnym Island Post would like to welcome you as a permanent member of our post office team, effective immediately. You will be living in the beautiful downtown Wistvale Post Office, mingle with many of the island\u2019s friendly residents, and become an essential part of our town\u2019s weekly operation with work so rewarding you\u2019ll never want to leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/76d7ea3631fea29cdf1142284523e30e.poster.avif?t=1755708810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/76d7ea3631fea29cdf1142284523e30e.webm?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/76d7ea3631fea29cdf1142284523e30e.mp4?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamp and process mail from our customers, a vital step in the mailing ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/aad48cc6c246042a2db451711a3ded70.poster.avif?t=1755708810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/aad48cc6c246042a2db451711a3ded70.webm?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/aad48cc6c246042a2db451711a3ded70.mp4?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort mail to ensure it gets to their correct locations.\u00a0 Let's keep the wheels of progress moving forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/6469162e5ded5f789689c6d6e423f005.poster.avif?t=1755708810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/6469162e5ded5f789689c6d6e423f005.webm?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/6469162e5ded5f789689c6d6e423f005.mp4?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our state of the art shredder will get rid of any unwanted items that end up in the mail system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, meet all the colorful characters of Kharnym Island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/98f75e2c3ff825384e9a3d44bf3de934.poster.avif?t=1755708810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/98f75e2c3ff825384e9a3d44bf3de934.webm?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/extras/98f75e2c3ff825384e9a3d44bf3de934.mp4?t=1755708810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compensation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free room/board, weekly pay depending on experience/work ethic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect to be contacted by your supervisor Liv very shortly, and welcome to your new home!</p>",
    "short_description": "Live out your wildest dreams of being a postal worker, stamping and sorting mail for residents of the mysterious island of Kharnym. Perform your duties, keep the mail running on time, and this could be the last job you'll ever need to work.",
